<title>BOLIVIA: SOCCER-BOLIVIA BEAT URUGUAY 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BOLIVIA BEAT URUGUAY 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>LA PAZ 1997-07-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bolivia beat Uruguay 1-0 (halftime 0-0) in a South American World Cup qualifier Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Marco Etcheverry (75)</p>
